<title>USA: TABLE- J. Baker July same store sales down.</title>
<headline>TABLE- J. Baker July same store sales down.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Ma 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		  $37	  $38	  NA	 -2.3</p>
<p>Year-to-date	$264	 $272	  NA	   NA</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is   four weeks ended	August 2.</p>
<p>Full company name is J. Baker Inc</p>
<p>Continuing sales include those from its three remaining divisions, namely Casual Male, Work 'n Gear and Licenses Discount.  The figures do not include sales from two divisions that the company has sold, namely Shoe Corporation of America and Parade of Shoes.</p>
